       STCKE_CNV_NULL   -2   The specified  tod_in  or  t_out  value is a null pointer.   


Programming considerations    An  epoch TOD clock  value has a resolution of only 62.5 nanoseconds. Therefore, TOD clock values in this format are not guaranteed to be unique when fast subsequent calls are made to read clock values. 



